      "claim": "Protein kinases catalyze the transfer of a phosphate group from ATP to specific amino‑acid residues on target proteins (phosphorylation).",
      "evidence": "Standard biochemical definition of protein kinases; enzymatic assays show ATP‑dependent phosphate transfer to substrates.",
      "weight": 0.35,
      "depends_on": []
